<article>
	<h1><span>Private Messages: View Message</span></h1>

	<ul class="nav">
		<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
		<li><a href="#fields">Fields</a></li>
		<li><a href="#toolbar">Toolbar</a></li>
	</ul>

	<section id="overview">
		<h2><span>Overview</span></h2>

		<p>This screen shows one private message sent to you. It is opened by clicking a message's subject in the
			Messages list.</p>
		<p>Opening an unread message marks it as read.
			Only the person a message was sent to can open it.</p>
	</section>
	<section id="fields">
		<h2><span>Fields</span></h2>

		<dl>
			<dt>From</dt>
			<dd>The name of the person who sent the message.</dd>

			<dt>Posted</dt>
			<dd>The date and time the message was sent, as <em>YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS</em>.</dd>

			<dt>Subject</dt>
			<dd>The subject of the message.</dd>

			<dt>Message</dt>
			<dd>The text of the message, shown as plain text.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="toolbar">
		<h2><span>Toolbar</span></h2>
		<p>At the top right you will see the toolbar.</p>
		<p>The functions are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Reply</dt>
			<dd>Opens the screen to write a reply, addressed to the sender, with the subject prefixed Re:.
				It is shown only when the sender is a Super Admin, or may manage private messages and log in to the
				administrator.</dd>

			<dt>Cancel</dt>
			<dd>Returns to the Messages list.</dd>

			<dt>Help</dt>
			<dd>Opens this help screen.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
</article>
